```csharp
public static int BinarySearch(int[] arr, int target)
{
    int left = 0;
    int right = arr.Length - 1;
    while (left <= right)
    {
        int mid = left + (right - left) / 2;
        if (arr[mid] == target)
        {
            return mid;
        }
        else if (arr[mid] < target)
        {
            left = mid + 1;
        }
        else
        {
            right = mid - 1;
        }
    }
    return -1;
}
```
Here's how you can use the above function:
